Description:
libwebm is used to handle WebM container I/O.

Local Changes:
Only keep:
 - Android.mk
 - AUTHORS.TXT
 - common/
    file_util.cc/h
    hdr_util.cc/h
    webmids.h
 - LICENSE.TXT
 - mkvmuxer/
 - mkvparser/
 - PATENTS.TXT

Patches on top of upstream:
 - mkvmuxer/mkvmuxer.cc/h: BlockAdditionMapping omits BlockAddIdValue when
   the value is 0; Tag supports set_track_uid() and writes Targets/TagTrackUID.
 - mkvmuxer/mkvwriter.cc/h: track seekability and bytes written so Position()
   works on non-seekable streams.
